WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.450
Someone once said...

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.690
There is rich, juicy Chicken 
Nanban made of bedrock...

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:00.060
Chicken Nanbedrock!

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:06.130
There are sweet, stamina-building 
eels that taste like pears...

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.400
Peareels!

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.840
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:19.380
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:28.050
Uwaaa! Astonishing Stun Apple!

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.330
Good morning, Terry, Obasaurus!

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.800
Toriko-san!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:49.640
Sorry!

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.040
Did I surprise you?

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.980
T-T-T-Toriko-san!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:57.220
W-What was that all about?!

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:00.520
Don't come to the door 
looking like evil incarnate!

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.120
My bad...

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.090
I was practicing for something, see.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.060
P-Practicing?

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.030
Practicing to scare somebody?

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.760
That's not a very nice thing to do.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.570
Nah, it's actually practice to 
surprise a certain ingredient!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.040
Stun Apple?

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:21.910
Yep.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.310
What is that?

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:25.040
This is the first I've heard of it.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:29.180
It's an unusual apple that changes 
taste when it's surprised.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.780
Stun Apples usually aren't on the market.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.390
Right. So it's no wonder 
you don't know about it.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.820
The apples are originally from Battle Island,

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.390
which is full of constantly fighting beasts.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.230
Several years ago, IGO took seeds from there

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.700
and were successful at cultivating it 
as a Special Preparation Ingredient.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.240
So you surprise the apple...

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.610
Yep. And the more you surprise 
it, the better it tastes!

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.140
What was that?!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.210
I can see it!

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.380
We're almost there!

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:05.350
Yeah. And they've already started, huh?

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.320
Surprise Island's Jamboree!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.250
S-Surprise Island?!

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.890
It's owned by IGO.

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:17.990
It's called Surprise Island

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.830
because the island is only used 
for cultivating Stun Apples.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.830
What are these explosions?!

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:28.240
In order to make the apples grow deliciously,

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:31.340
they fire explosives 
around the orchards 24/7!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.710
Explosives?!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.150
Well, there aren't any farmers on the island

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.480
and nobody lives here.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.020
Nobody <i>could</i> live here with this racket!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.720
Let's go, Komatsu!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.250
R-Right...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.120
Well, I'll wait here for you.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.560
I'm expecting some delicious Stun Apples!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.890
Leave it to us!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.160
We'll scare the living daylights out of 'em!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:05.970
It's gotten even louder!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:09.410
Stun Apples are in season only once a year,

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.180
and this is it!

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:16.150
Every year at this time, the Jamboree 
is held to freak out the Stun Apples

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.250
and it's attended by tens of thousands 
of people from all over the world.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.120
That's why there's even more of a 
ruckus kicked up on the island itself.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.760
So this is the place where somebody wants 
to get the crap scared out of 'em, huh?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.860
Well, if that's the case,

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:31.070
I'll spook 'em so badly,

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:34.300
piss will come sprayin' out 
of every pore of their body!

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.410
Zonge-sama! Piss is spraying 
out of every pore of <i>your</i> body!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.240
I've never seen anyone get 
scared like that before...

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.680
Z-Zouri-san...

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.950
It's Zonge, not Zouri!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.690
Well, well, is that the 
ancient king, a Battle Wolf?

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:58.390
Aren't you a member of G7?!

00:05:58.390 --> 00:06:01.790
That famous Taste Master, Apollo, right?!

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.630
And you're the man behind Century Soup,

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.040
Chef Komatsu of Hotel Gourmet, aren't you?

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.100
You know of me?!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.670
I'm touched!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:16.540
You're one of the Four Gourmet Kings, Toriko.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:20.880
There are many promising 
contenders this year.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.820
Promising contenders...?

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.380
He must mean us.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.320
Sounds like people are 
riding their hopes on me.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.760
Teppei-san!

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:33.060
Well, I am a Reviver who's 
known pretty far and wide...

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:36.060
There's nothing I can really do about it.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.200
I guess fame is the price I have to pay.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.630
Not that I seek it out...

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.530
As always, you go on and on...

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.540
R-Rin!

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:46.200
Surprised?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.040
You're here, too?!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.310
I figured you would be here, Toriko,

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:53.040
so I came here in secret to surprise you!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.750
Um, why are you here, Teppei-san?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.880
Oh, the Master ordered me.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:01.390
I'm here to do biological 
research on the Stun Apples.

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.350
This isn't the first time, though.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.720
I swear, the Master treats me like a slave...

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:09.060
So even Yosaku-san's interested, huh?

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:11.500
And of course, I'm here, too!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.630
Tina-san!

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.770
Haven't we been running into these 
people entirely too much lately?

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.240
It's just a coincidence, Toriko-san.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.970
I'm counting on everyone!

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:26.940
I wanna get a high-level heaping 
helping of a scoop on these apples!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:31.480
Well, everyone, I bid you good luck!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.050
But why is a Taste Master here?

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:39.290
To check the taste of the Stun Apples.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.090
Stun Apples have human-like faces.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:43.830
With expressions, too.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.630
That's why they're also 
called Human Face Apples.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.130
H-Human Face Apples?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:52.300
You can tell more or less 
by how surprised they are,

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:57.040
but to really judge the tastiness, 
somebody has to eat them.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.740
What is this?!

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:05.080
That's a Stun Apple.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.520
Th-They really do have faces!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.880
They're alive!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.150
I mean, are these really considered fruit?!

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.860
They're surprised by the 
sounds of the explosions.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.260
Get even more scared!

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:25.970
E-Everyone's really into this...

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:29.300
That's 'cause scared Stun 
Apples can be sold for a mint.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.340
Everybody's desperate.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:32.810
What's that?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:36.040
A Microphone Stone I got from the first Melk.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.380
Cover your ears.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.500
I did it!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.940
Amazing! Only Toriko could do that!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.710
He must've scared it half to death!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.010
Th-This is a heaping helping of a scoop!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.880
Gourmet Hunter Toriko did it!

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.450
Now, what will the Surprise Level be?!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.490
Let me have a look.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.320
Well, now, I believe...

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.230
The Surprise Level...

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:28.760
...is 27!

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.860
Level 27!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.500
That's the highest level of the day!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.200
Wonderful! That's my Toriko!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.140
Um... What's a Surprise Level?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.440
It's the numerical value that indicates 
just how surprised a Stun Apple is.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:46.210
It goes from level 1 to 100, and that 
determines the price of the apple.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.480
For example, firing an automatic weapon,

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.580
that's level 3.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.050
Up to level 3, you'd get 
50,000 yen times the level.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:54.420
The blast from a bazooka is level 4 or more,

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:58.690
while it would take a missile 
being fired to get up to level 60.

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.730
Incidentally, with levels 4 through 60,

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:03.190
the price is 500,000 yen times the level.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:06.400
In other words, Toriko's is level 27,

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.300
so that's 27 times 500,000 yen.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.540
A grand total of 13,500,000 yen!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:15.040
Over 10,000,000, just like that!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:19.340
But a huge shock like 
that is level 27, right?

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:22.050
Will anyone get any higher than that?

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.850
Of course!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:28.220
In the past, a few people 
have even exceeded level 90.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.090
Really?!

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.560
Then I'll do the same!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.190
Level 90...

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:39.030
No, I'll reach the very top, level 100!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.920
After Toriko reached level 27,

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.520
things here at Stun Orchards 
have been a heaping help of...

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.820
...heating up!

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:09.860
Let's see...

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.430
Let's investigate how surprised you can be.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:16.900
But I don't think I'm cut 
out for a place like this.

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:21.200
In the first place, I've got a 
quiet, unassuming personality.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:24.270
I don't know the first 
thing about scaring fruit.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.480
And all this commotion 
is giving me a headache.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:32.410
As I said, I'm a quiet guy, right?

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:36.080
I'm only here under the 
orders of my Master, see?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.760
It got sick of your talking and fell asleep!

00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:42.820
Scream like that!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.100
How was that?!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.200
Bet its heart leaped out of its chest, huh?!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.270
No. No reaction at all...

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:56.470
In fact, it's not even looking at you!

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.210
What?! Is this apple makin' 
a monkey outta me?!

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:02.080
I'll just eat it like this!

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.480
This is a Falcon's Fire Talon, 
which becomes fiery hot

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:11.120
through spiciness alone.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.990
I've also got Red-face Garlic, supposedly 
so spicy it'll turn your face

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.160
as red as an ogre's.

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:19.290
Then I fry up some Burning 
Pasta, said to be so spicy

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.960
flames will shoot out of your mouth,

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.330
and voila!

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.230
Special peperoncino!

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:28.330
I call it Peperoncheezus-this-is-hot!

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:31.240
Thank you for the food!

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:43.050
Good an' spicy!!

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.120
This spiciness is shooting right 
through the top of my noggin!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.590
Makin' me cry out with gusto!

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:58.160
I-Its delicious spiciness has 
amplified Toriko's scream!

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:01.200
My hat's off to you, Chef Komatsu!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.170
Thank you!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.810
Thank you for the meal.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.080
Level...

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.580
28!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.710
Today's high has risen again!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.620
But level 90's still a long way off!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.760
This is certainly a clamorous place.

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.190
That's Mama Icicle!

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.500
She's the owner of Snack Icicle!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.130
That's the ultra-famous snack pub owner

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:36.830
who's also one of the top 
50 chefs in the world?!

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:40.840
I heard she used to be a 
damn good Gourmet Hunter.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:45.210
Perhaps I'll take two or 
three of these myself.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.910
You needn't be frightened of me.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:54.250
I'm not going to kill you.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:58.050
However, I am going to pickle you in formalin

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.890
and use you as a decoration in my pub,

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.760
where you'll live in stasis, 
forever and ever...

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.100
Level 20!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.870
An incredible method of surprise!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.040
The Stun Apple is petrified!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.410
Wow!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.810
Intimidation!

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.210
So that's another way to scare them!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:25.350
Yeah. Throwing a scare into a 
Stun Apple is no simple trick.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:30.050
In fact, I've heard there are some that 
don't even twitch from noise or shocks.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.650
Oh, this is seasoned just right.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.520
That's Mama Icicle for you!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.860
I'll have to go to her pub one night.

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:39.560
I'll get Toriko to praise me, too!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.060
Super Relaxation!

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:49.670
After it completely relaxes...

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.650
Level 19.

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.350
I lost to Mama Icicle!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.650
Why weren't you more surprised?!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.090
Toriko won't compliment me this way!

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.020
Level up!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:09.190
Level 20!

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.490
Yay!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.660
The same level as Mama Icicle!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:15.960
Maybe I'll sell this apple 
and open up my own pub...

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.030
And the only customer is Toriko!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.270
Oh, come on...

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.040
The thing is,

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:26.670
I get it that Master wants 
to make me stronger.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:31.080
I'm sure that's why he sent me here 
on my own to investigate you fruits.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.950
But telling me to scare you Stun 
Apples and then record the results,

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.820
that really puts me on the spot.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:38.250
Quiet fellow that I am,

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.520
freaking out fruit just 
isn't in my wheelhouse.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:45.120
Now of course, Master's orders 
are orders, so I will do it.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.090
But, you know...

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:54.130
It seems to be shocked by 
how long he's been talking!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.270
Level 30!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:59.070
We've got a new record for the day! Level 30!

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:09.550
It laughed at me!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.790
Wonderful, Battle Wolf!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.190
Level 40!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.130
Awesome, Terry!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.300
No, I don't think you stand a chance.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.050
Level 25!

00:16:44.180 --> 00:16:45.180
What did it do?!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.450
I feel like I caught one gram of 
a Wall Penguin's true personality!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.320
Alright, for this next one,

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.130
I'm gonna threaten it 
with a show of strength!

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.060
17-fold...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:03.030
...Spiked Punch!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.040
Stopping just before!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.410
Uh-oh.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.750
What a shame!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:20.120
That would've been a level 50!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:22.050
But you made it faint.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.820
I guess I pulled my punch too close to it.

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.460
And it was too powerful.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.720
Sorry about that, Stun Apple!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.990
I-It was disqualified,

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:33.960
but that punch had a destructive force 
that would put a missile to shame!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.230
That's Gourmet Hunter Toriko for you!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.300
I did my best and got to level 50, huh?

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.540
Hey, Apollo...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.570
Yes?

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:50.210
Who the heck got to Surprise 
Level 90 with Stun Apples?

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.320
There have been three thus far.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:58.690
President Ichiryu of IGO achieved level 95.

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:05.530
And Knocking Master Jiro reached level 92.

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.000
That makes sense.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.930
Old man Ichiryu and Knocking Master Jiro...

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:12.500
I'll buy that.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.940
The old man got to level 92?!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.010
So who's the last person?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:21.010
It's off the record,

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:27.510
but word has it that someone from 
Gourmet Corp also made it to the 90s.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.080
Gourmet Corp, huh?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:35.790
I gotta train more so that I can 
at least get into the 70s or 80s...

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:40.290
Stun Apples are surprised by the unexpected,

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:48.670
so catching them off guard or doing 
something unpredictable may be a good idea.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.040
I never could have predicted 
the way you talk!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:55.110
Catch them off guard, eh?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.740
Alright. I won't throw in the towel yet.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:00.380
Thank you, Apollo-san!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.380
Not at all, Toriko-san.

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.380
I pray for your Food Luck.

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:07.920
I'll aim to open two pubs!

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:10.520
And maybe I'll try to at 
least get to the point

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.760
where the Stun Apples don't laugh at me!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.060
What's this?!

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:25.700
L-Level 80!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:28.210
One of these people?!

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:31.810
Someone strong enough to reach level 80?!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.050
Don't tell me Gourmet Corp...

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:41.120
I ain't gonna take it no more!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.750
That's it! I'm goin' home!

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:45.420
Zonge-same, we're leaving?!

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:49.190
Cripes! It won't even look at 
me let alone be scared of me!

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:50.700
This is what you get!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.600
This is level 80!

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.770
W-What?!

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:06.810
My time has come at last!

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:09.610
G-Goodness! L-Level 80's been reached!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.250
With the power of his fart!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.180
Yeah...

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.180
That guy got 80?!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.650
And by letting one go...

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:16.920
I've completely lost any enthusiasm I had.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:19.060
This one's going to be shelved...

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:22.790
Not even one gram of this 
vulgarity can be broadcast...

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:25.030
I knew you had it in you, Zonge-sama!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:29.100
Level 80, that's 80 million 
yen for just one fart!

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:32.300
This man really is amazing!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.370
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.210
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.950
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:49.790
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:52.620
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.460
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:58.190
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.000
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:03.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.370
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:21:05.370 --> 00:21:06.800
and it'll be more and more

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.140
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.940
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.810
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:18.080
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.410
Such a waste!

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:22.250
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:25.050
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:30.660
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:33.560
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.770
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.230
The Hunt... for Toriko's Lunch!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:44.100
We're switching gears for 
today's Dishing with Tina,

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.940
and are going to visit Gourmet 
Hunter Toriko's house!

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:50.240
When you bring up Toriko's house,

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.450
the first thing you think of 
is that it's a candy house,

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:53.910
built by famous architect, Mr. Smile.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.880
I can't wait to see what it's like inside!

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.620
There is no house!

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:04.790
Well, a development like 
this is completely expected.

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:07.890
But where did Toriko go?!

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:12.530
I have no idea what that meant!

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:15.800
If Toriko is a no-show, there's no show!

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:18.570
Only one thing to do! And that is...

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:22.880
T-Today's guest is Obasaurus-san!

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.750
What's your favorite food, Oba-san?

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:30.550
Um...

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:33.950
O-Oh, really? Mustard lotus root!

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:35.620
Elegant answer!

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:38.890
Do you have a favorite type?

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:42.190
Get out of town! Garara Gators?!

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:44.260
I wasn't expecting that!

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:46.930
I'm your type, too, you say?!

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:48.670
That's too bad!

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:50.770
I'm a second-rate gourmet newscaster,

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:52.840
so I can't afford to fall in love now!

00:22:52.840 --> 00:22:54.740
I mean, I am flattered...

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:56.940
Wait, you put me on the same 
level as a Garara Gator?!

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:59.610
What do you think I am?!

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:01.310
T-Tina-san...

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:03.050
What are you doing?!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.250
Toriko's buying land?

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:10.830
And one plot costs ten billion yen?!

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:12.830
Why's it so expensive?

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:16.760
Chicken Beast's Egg! the Memories of Old Man Yocchi and His Wife!

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:18.950
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
